<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Natural Gas.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Natural Gas.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it upgraded Consolidated Natural Gas Co to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Ron Barone, James Yannello and Kimberly Stewart, in a research report, cited solid fundamentals and unwarranted price weakness.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 51-1/4 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
